config BR2_PACKAGE_SINTY_DEVICE_TOOLS
	bool "sinty-device-tools"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_HOST_GO_TARGET_ARCH_SUPPORTS
	help
	  The on-device tools of the Sinty device catalog: the firmware a
	  profile takes from the Android vendor partition still on the
	  device, and the Atom Loops kernel hook that keeps a phone's boot
	  partitions on the kernel of the root it runs.

	  https://github.com/singularityos-lab/sinty-devices
